        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hn">Hn</ref> 94.3</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 94.3" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="611" ed="#liebermann"/>Si plures unum aliquem uulnerent precepto domini sui, et uelit in quibus poterit warantus<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="k" target="#Hn_94-3.lnote.oe.k"/> esse, solus emendet pro omnibus, sicut malum fecerint, et unam witam cui rectum erit.</ab>
